Package: stempeluhr-all-in-one
Version: 6.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-requests, pcscd, python3-pyscard
Maintainer: Stempeluhr Project
Description: Stempeluhr 6 server and terminal all-in-one
 Complete Stempeluhr installation including terminal support for RFID and
 Android HCE. The HCE agent is activated only when a PC/SC reader is present.
